// Motion Prompt #193 · MIT License (c) 2026 Shohei Ohtaki · https://showheyohtaki.github.io/motion-prompt/#193
//
// Watercolor / 水彩画
// Pack: artstyle (Art styles for image generation) · element 01 · Category: Painting & printmaking
// What happens: The line drawing of a house, a tree and the sun becomes a pale transparent watercolor, with colors bleeding and pooling and the white paper left showing.
// Motion spec:
//   - Medium: transparent watercolor on paper
//   - Look: colors that bleed and pool, white paper left unpainted, pale colors overall
//   - Sample: the same base sketch (a line drawing of a house, a tree and the sun on a hill) was given to an image model as a reference and redrawn in this style. A diagonal wipe turns the sketch into the style from 0.5 s to 1.35 s, the picture slowly zooms to 1.045x until 4.0 s, and it fades back to the sketch from 4.0 s to 4.5 s (one pass = 4.7 s, cubic ease-in-out)
// When to use it: For picture books, illustrations or seasonal cards that should feel soft and hand-painted.
// Tags: watercolor, painting, soft, bleed, hand-painted, paper
// Size: 539x208 px · Cycle: 4.7 s
// Needs: kit artstyle -> https://showheyohtaki.github.io/motion-prompt/api/v1/kit/artstyle.js
// Live demo: https://showheyohtaki.github.io/motion-prompt/#193
//
// cells[i](k, w, h, u): k = CanvasRenderingContext2D (already cleared and wrapped in save/restore by the caller), w,h = size, u = seconds in [0, cycle). The picture depends only on u.
// Element code starts here. CELLS, constants and helpers live in the kit.

// @element 01
// 水彩画: にじみと白い余白が残る淡い絵
CELLS[0] = (k, w, h, u) => gafu(k, w, h, u, '01');
